<BaseLayout seo={{title:'About — GAME//BRIEF',description:'GAME//BRIEF is an independent gaming news outlet covering releases, industry moves, hardware, esports and guides.',path:'/about'}}><section class="container max-w-3xl py-10"><p class="kicker">Trust</p><h1 class="text-5xl font-black">About GAME//BRIEF</h1><div class="prose-gb mt-6"><p>GAME//BRIEF is an independent gaming news outlet built around one idea: get readers the signal, skip the noise. We cover game releases, industry moves, hardware, esports and practical guides for people who take games seriously.</p><h2>Who's behind it</h2><p>GAME//BRIEF is owned and run by <strong>activex</strong>, who oversees editorial direction and site operations. The day-to-day reporting is handled by a small team of three writers working under activex, covering news, reviews and guides across the site.</p><h2>How we work</h2><p>We aim to be fast without cutting corners on accuracy. Stories are edited before publishing, corrections are made openly when we get something wrong, and our coverage decisions aren't influenced by advertisers or platform holders. For more detail on how we source and verify stories, see our <a href="/editorial-policy">Editorial Policy</a>.</p><h2>Get in touch</h2><p>Tips, corrections, partnership or advertising inquiries can be sent to <a href="mailto:officialbeyondsense@gmail.com">officialbeyondsense@gmail.com</a>, or through our <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
